# Adlaire-Design-System Master Specification

Version: rev.126

`Docs/Master_Spec` is the overall source of truth for Adlaire-Design-System.

The current repository name is `Adlaire-Design`. The formal system name is `Adlaire-Design-System`.

## Purpose

Adlaire-Design-System is a repository-local frontend foundation for Adlaire products. It defines tokens, CSS contracts, UI JavaScript contracts, WYSIWYG Editor UI, structured editor output, brand assets, official icons, samples, checks, and governance rules.

It is not a React/Vue/Svelte replacement, not a utility-first CSS framework, and not an npm package workspace. The system is framework-independent and repository-owned.

