## Catalog Boundaries

| Catalog | Owns | Does not own |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `Docs/Generic_Component_Catalog` | Generic public UI, content UI, form UI, layout UI, Git Provider UI. | WYSIWYG-only UI, Admin-only UI, official SVG files. |
| `Docs/Admin_UI_Catalog` | Admin-only UI and management workflows. | Generic-only UI, WYSIWYG-only UI. |
| `Docs/WYSIWYG_Editor_UI_Catalog` | WYSIWYG Editor UI components and states. | Generic UI, Admin UI, editor internals. |
